Current build: BuildV3.2

A small game where the main characters Z-Axis is unlocked. Try to beat (so far) 4 challenging levels (you probably wont)!

I mainly made this project as a little thing in my coding school, where we learn how to code. The coach gave us some simple stuff, but I wanted to go further. 
So, I added some more features, like a turret, a node enemy, and a shop. So far, I am very happy with how this is turning out.

Here are the controls:

w= Perform a LARGE jump

a-d = Move left to right

space = Normally jump

e = Lock your Z-Axis (Only reason i added this is because i was getting complaints about it being unlocked at really bad times.)

q = unlocks z-axis 

m = menu

And keep in mind, your feet MUST be touching the ground in order to jump.

You CAN double jump.

This game is VERY unforgiving, so know that you will die... a lot.

Level 5 is currently unavailible to players, and is not shown in the level select menu.

